  "title": "Immunic to Participate in the 8th Annual Evercore ISI Healthcare Conference in December",
  "summary": "NEW YORK, November 26, 2025 – Immunic, Inc., today announcedthat Daniel Vitt, Ph.D., Chief Executive Officer of Immunic, will participate in a fireside chat on Thursday, December 4, 2025 at 9:35 am ET at the 8th Annual Evercore ISI Healthcare Conference, taking place December 2-4, 2025 in Coral Gables, FL.",
